# Line endings.
# NOTE: raw.githubusercontent.com serves the committed bytes directly, so .cmd files
# MUST be stored with CRLF in the repository or Windows batch goto/labels break.
# (-text disables git's text normalisation for them, keeping the CRLF bytes as committed.)
* text=auto
*.cmd -text
*.bat -text
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.md  text eol=lf
